HKLM,Software\vmdisp9x\vesa,VRAMLimit,,128
; No VRAM read-back test at boot: on a real card (RX 560 under CSMWrap) it
; shrank the VRAM size below what 1024x768 and up need, and DIBENG faulted
; (exception 0D) after a mode change (docs/win9x-modern-2026-09-30.md).
HKLM,Software\vmdisp9x\vesa,NoMemTest,,"1"

